# Line-ending policy for this repository.
# All text files are stored and checked out as LF regardless of the local
# core.autocrlf setting (e.g. Git for Windows defaults it to true, which
# would otherwise turn files into CRLF and break the SHA-256 integrity
# manifest / runtime digest verification). Binary files are never converted.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Packaging artifacts and images are binary: never convert, never diff.
*.tgz    -text
*.tar.gz -text
*.tar    -text
*.png    -text
*.jpg    -text
*.jpeg   -text
*.gif    -text
*.ico    -text